+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   Timeline walk (components/site/sections/timeline.tsx + timeline-art.tsx): three founders in blazers, seen from above, walk down
+   the glowing line while you scroll; under the leave year two of them sit on benches in a small garden. All colours are theme
+   colours (hue offsets around --th), so a visitor's colour choice recolours the characters and the garden too. */
