+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   The office of the last year (components/site/timeline-office.tsx, timeline-boards.tsx): a full screen seen from above. The big
+   drawings (boss chairs, year, decor) are sized in "units": one unit is --p (= --u px, set by the script from the size of the
+   screen); a department corner is drawn on a 300 x 226 px canvas and scaled with --zs. Colours are theme colours. */
+.tl-end {
