+/* the reception: a room of layers (components/site/contact-reception.tsx). --px / --py (-1..1) are the pointer; every layer moves by its own
+   amount (far things a little, near things more), the character looks at the pointer. The edges are out of focus and the bottom melts into
+   the section below. */
+.rc-scene {
