ortOrder])\n}\n\n// One person of the office on the Team page (Team in the admin panel). `dept` is the department (the people of one department sit in one\n// corner of the office, in the order of `sortOrder`); `photo` is a link (/media/<id> for an uploaded picture); `girl` draws the avatar as a woman.\nmodel TeamMember {\n  id        String   @id @default(cuid())\n  name      String\n  role      String   @default(\"\")\n  dept      String   @default(\"Team\")\n  bio       String   @default(\"\")\n  photo     String   @default(\"\")\n  linkedin  String   @default(\"\")\n  girl      Boolean  @default(false)\n  sortOrder Int      @default(0)\n  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\n  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt\n\n  @@index([sortOrder])\n}\n",
